@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Create a site
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sites
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Johannesburg Head Office" }

### List sites
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sites

### Create a meter at site 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sites/1/meters
Content-Type: application/json

{ "serialNumber": "EM-0001" }

### List meters at site 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sites/1/meters

### Record readings for meter 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/meters/1/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "timestampUtc": "2026-11-03T08:00:00Z", "valueKwh": 12600.5 }

### Same timestamp again -> 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/meters/1/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "timestampUtc": "2026-11-03T08:00:00Z", "valueKwh": 12601.0 }

### Timestamp without a zone -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/meters/1/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "timestampUtc": "2026-11-03T09:00:00", "valueKwh": 12601.0 }

### List readings (optional inclusive range)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/meters/1/readings?fromUtc=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&toUtc=2026-11-02T23:59:59Z

### Consumption summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/meters/1/summary?fromUtc=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&toUtc=2026-11-02T23:59:59Z

### fromUtc after toUtc -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/meters/1/summary?fromUtc=2026-11-05T00:00:00Z&toUtc=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z
